{#
  Syscall Console Panel - Experience Replay Buffer Visualization

  OPUS-031 Layer 2: Makes the system's "thoughts" visible.

  This is NOT a log viewer - it's a window into the system's
  learning process. Successful syscalls become few-shot examples.

  Required context:
    - syscalls.history: List[Dict] - Recent syscall entries
    - syscalls.stats: Dict - Aggregated statistics

  Design Decisions (OPUS-031):
    - DD1: SyscallEntry = Experience Replay (not logs)
    - The system learns from its own successes
#}

